mflux - https://github.com/filipstrand/mflux

gmlx ports parts of mflux's Z-Image transformer at commit
e066d98ed1f544e618890a7d62067df7773a123d, with modifications:

- gmlx/image/families/z_image/model.py: the module tree and forward of
  src/mflux/models/z_image/model/z_image_transformer/ (transformer.py,
  transformer_block.py, context_block.py, attention.py, feed_forward.py,
  timestep_embedder.py and final_layer.py). gmlx keeps the fused qkv
  product, names modules after the GGUF tensors, and routes the
  elementwise and attention steps through gmlx/image/ops.
- gmlx/image/ops/attention.py: the q and k norm and the RoPE product of
  attention.py.
- gmlx/image/ops/embeds.py: the sinusoidal timestep embedding of
  timestep_embedder.py and the N-axis RoPE tables of rope_embedder.py.
  gmlx computes the RoPE angles in float64 on the host.

